*       UPA_Image_Fit -- attribute of UP-Image.mcc
*
*   FUNCTION
*       BOOL: scale to the box keeping the aspect (the box then stretches); default FALSE = the picture size
*
*   INPUTS
*       UPA_Image_Fit - access I. Tag value from <mcc/up.h>.
*
*   RESULT
*       Read with GetAttr/get(), set with SetAttrs/set() or in the MUI_NewObject tag list, as the access letters allow (I = initial, S = set, G = get).
*
*   SEE ALSO
*       <mcc/up.h>, UP-Image.mcc
*
******/

